  {
   "id": "dark-deception-monsters-mortals-167508@major-2020-11-28",
   "gameId": "dark-deception-monsters-mortals-167508",
   "displayName": "Elementary Evil Update (And More)!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2020-11-28T21:53:41.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Great news - it's update time! There's a ton of new content in this update to share with you all! Here's a quick breakdown of what's new in the Elementary Evil Update:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The store is now active. Spend your shards & red shards in the store to unlock Extras items and new skins.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Elementary Evil map is now playable, featuring a new type of trap, a new boss, and new music!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "21 new skins (total) for existing mortal & monster characters! Unlock them in the store!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Soul Collection mode has been added! Compete against 4 mortals and collect shards to save your soul from Malak. Each shard wave, Malak will come for the mortal with the fewest shards. In the end, only one mortal gets to keep their soul. Will it be you? The others will be turned into mindless monsters!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "New additions to the Extras menu! Now you can see & track your stats as you play matches. Build your stats up to unlock higher stat tiers! There is also an art gallery where you can check out art purchased from the store!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "New leveling system! Those wins count for more than just red shards now. Accumulate wins in order to level up and gain new rewards!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "UI/UX improvements! A bit more uniformity in the menu system.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Major & minor bug fixes.: Enjoy the new update and get ready for the Monstrum DLC (which is coming up next) :)!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
